        "text_subline": "B2B Solutions",
        "text_heading_1": "Brand & Corporate Identity",
        "textarea_subheading_1": "DICOTA is the ideal partner for branded corporate identity solutions: customized bags, backpacks and sleeves turn device protection into a visible brand experience — creating higher-margin business with HR, marketing and management stakeholders.",
